Error [E0927]: `#Tag` isn't a known applied rule
  --> tests/ui/marker_retired_tag.jet:1:2
    |
  1 | #Tag("event")
    |  ^^^
 Why: `Tag` isn't registered as an applied rule — Jet rules are a closed, registered vocabulary (I7), not any PascalCase word.
 Fix: Did you mean `#Flag`?
